cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Ledger Monitor's compiled tables or charts, please cite the project as below.
  Each figure comes from a named publisher, listed in data/<dashboard>/sources.json; please
  credit the original publisher as well, and check DATA_LICENSE.md for sources with stricter terms.
title: Ledger Monitor
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Eighteen open-data dashboards on the systems behind everyday life, with country profiles and
  downloadable CSV and JSON tables. Every number links to the report it came from.
authors:
  - name: jahit
    website: https://github.com/jahitjanberk
repository-code: https://github.com/jahitjanberk/ledger-monitor
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - open data
  - dashboards
  - data visualisation
  - public statistics
